\ A mutual tail-recursive cycle through an `if` arm. Every edge is a tail call, so the interpreter
\ runs two million iterations in constant native stack, and so does every compile mode.
\
\ No flags, so the eager run checks the same golden. The hybrid twin is
\ hybrid_tail_boundary_mutual_cycle.1z.

pong: ( n -- ) [ 1 - ping ] ;
ping: ( n -- ) [ dup 0 > [ pong ] [ drop "done" print-line ] if ] ;

[ 2000000 ping ] [ error-type: @get . wipe ] recover
